    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exceptionally powerful solar eclipse allowed the creator to conjure up the forest spirit Rarach. This rascally creature was given the ability to wrap in a bubble to move quickly through the flying mountains. Along the way, Rarach learns about this magical world and gains new abilities that accelerate the journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An important point on the spirit's journey was marked out by the creator. Rarach must pass through the rift into another world to fulfill an important task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extraordinary Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethereal Envoy is an adventure game about swift travel through wondrous worlds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the flying mountains and beyond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to your advantage and keep up the momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform evasive maneuvers to avoid obstacles at high speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harden your bubble to deflect enemy attacks or break through barriers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find wells of power that upgrade your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover  more about the arcane worlds and why you were sent through the rift.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exceptionally powerful solar eclipse allowed the creator to conjure up the forest spirit Rarach. This rascally creature was given the ability to wrap in a bubble to move quickly through the flying mountains. Along the way, Rarach learns about this magical world and gains new abilities that accelerate the journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An important point on the spirit's journey was marked out by the creator. Rarach must pass through the rift into another world to fulfill an important task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extraordinary Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethereal Envoy is an adventure game about swift travel through wondrous worlds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the flying mountains and beyond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to your advantage and keep up the momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform evasive maneuvers to avoid obstacles at high speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harden your bubble to deflect enemy attacks or break through barriers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find wells of power that upgrade your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover  more about the arcane worlds and why you were sent through the rift.</p></li></ul>",
